eral end  en face   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Uninvolved  lateral to mass  Received are 5 containers  which are all  labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME   REMOVE_MRN  Received in formalin  labeled  additional margins deep   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm aggregate of unoriented yellow lobulated adipose tissue fragments  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  additional margins lateral   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of unoriented yellow lobulated adipose tissue fragments  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  additional margins superior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm unoriented fragment of yellow lobulated adipose tissue  The specimens are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  additional margins inferior   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm aggregate of unoriented yellow fibroadipose tissue fragments  Each fragment is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Received in formalin  labeled  additional margin medial   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm aggregate of unoriented yellow fibroadipose tissue fragments  The fragments are serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS  FROZEN SECTION  1    1 DEEP  FX 1    1 DEEP   LEFT SENTINEL NODE   NO CARCINOMA SEEN  Final Diagnosis by Ritu Ghai M D   Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 22   REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05 33 22PM By his her signature above  the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses  ADDENDUM NOTE  REASON   1 QUANTITATIVE RESULTS OF IMMUNOHISTOCHEMICAL STAINING FOR RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Left  block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID    The tumor cells stain for estrogen rec